   "dur": 9.3,
   "speaker": "Clerk",
   "en": "Благодарим за покупки у нас.",
   "enabled": true,
   "last": true,
   "en_src": "Thank you for shopping with us."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_000b",
   "file": 72,
   "chan": 15,
   "start": 49455,
   "end": 50151,
   "dur": 9.3,
   "speaker": "Clerk",
   "en": "\"Джой Дивижн\" - магазин, где есть всё.",
   "enabled": true,
   "last": true,
   "en_src": "Joy Division, the store that has everything."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_001",
   "file": 44,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 25721,
   "end": 26201,
   "dur": 3.2,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Ладно, беру эту кассету.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "All right, I'll take this video."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_002",
   "file": 45,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 26217,
   "end": 26507,
   "dur": 1.9,
   "speaker": "Clerk",
   "en": "Любите вы развлечься, сэр.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "You certainly like your entertainment, sir."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_002b",
   "file": 45,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 26579,
   "end": 26665,
   "dur": 0.6,
   "speaker": "Clerk",
   "en": "Спасибо!",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Thank you!"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_003",
   "file": 46,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 26681,
   "end": 26863,
   "dur": 1.2,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Купил, Метал!",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "I bought it, Metal!"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_003b",
   "file": 46,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 26936,
   "end": 27369,
   "dur": 2.5,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "И что теперь? Есть аппарат, на котором это крутить?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Now what? Is there a machine that can play this tape?"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_004",
   "file": 47,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 27385,
   "end": 27881,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Это сложно. Возможно, их больше не осталось.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "That could be difficult. There may be none left."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_005",
   "file": 48,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 27897,
   "end": 28361,
   "dur": 3.1,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Ч-что? Тогда она бесполезна!",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Wh-what? Then it's useless!"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_006",
   "file": 49,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 28377,
   "end": 28921,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Постой, есть способ. Я сам её воспроизведу.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Wait, there's a way. I'll play it myself."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_007",
   "file": 50,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 28937,
   "end": 29033,
   "dur": 0.6,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Ты так умеешь?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Can you do that?"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_008",
   "file": 51,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 29049,
   "end": 29257,
   "dur": 1.4,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Попробую.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "I'll try to make it work."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_009",
   "file": 52,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 29273,
   "end": 29657,
   "dur": 2.6,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Рассчитываю на тебя. Ты знаешь, что делать. Держи.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "I'm counting on you. You know what to do. Here."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_010",
   "file": 53,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 29673,
   "end": 30170,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Сначала воспроизведу у себя внутри.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "I'll play it internally first."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_010b",
   "file": 53,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 30235,
   "end": 30825,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Потом сохраню картинку в памяти.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Then I'll store the images in my memory."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_011",
   "file": 55,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 32201,
   "end": 32969,
   "dur": 5.1,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Что такое, Метал?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "What's wrong, Metal?"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_012",
   "file": 57,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 33705,
   "end": 33977,
   "dur": 1.8,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Метал!",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Metal!"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_013",
   "file": 59,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 34345,
   "end": 34697,
   "dur": 2.3,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Эй, Метал! Что случилось?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Hey, Metal! What's wrong?"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_014",
   "file": 61,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 35865,
   "end": 36185,
   "dur": 2.1,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Дай и мне посмотреть, Метал!",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Let me see too, Metal!"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_015",
   "file": 62,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 36201,
   "end": 37113,
   "dur": 6.1,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Ну, это было так жарко, что данные стёрлись.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Well, it was so intense that it wiped out the data."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_016",
   "file": 63,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 37129,
   "end": 37241,
   "dur": 0.7,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Стёрлись?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Wiped it out?"
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_017",
   "file": 64,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 37257,
   "end": 37657,
   "dur": 2.7,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Да. Изображения пропали.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Yes. The images are gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_018",
   "file": 65,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 37673,
   "end": 38201,
   "dur": 3.5,
   "speaker": "Gillian",
   "en": "Пропали? Вечно мне везёт.",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Gone? Just my luck."
  },
  {
   "id": "B0E0_019",
   "file": 66,
   "chan": 1,
   "start": 38217,
   "end": 38505,
   "dur": 1.9,
   "speaker": "Metal Gear",
   "en": "Хочешь, перескажу?",
   "enabled": true,
   "en_src": "Would you like me to describe it?"
